    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the adrenaline-pumping world of &quot;Hellmet: Bullets, Beams, and Blades,&quot; a top-down twin-stick shooter that pays homage to the golden era of arcade classics. With its vibrant 2D retro pixel art style, this game offers a blistering blend of intense shooting action, dynamic combat, and strategic gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced Shooting Action: Navigate through hordes of varied enemies and unleash a hail of bullets and beams to clear your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Arsenal: Equip a variety of weapons and power-ups to tailor your offensive prowess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different biomes: Visit a variety of different planets to uncover new technology and meet new challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agile Maneuverability: Master the art of the dash, jump, bash, roll, shield and run to outsmart your foes and avoid incoming fire, traps and hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Boss Fights: Confront formidable bosses that require quick reflexes and tactical thinking to defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Aesthetics: Dive into a world of nostalgic pixel art graphics that bring each battle to life with explosive colors and meticulous detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find resources and build your base to unlock new features, characters and abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660600/extras/8623973b537d4b0cfd86da93e96c11b6.webp?t=1749194333\" width=28 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a